% -*- mode: prolog; coding: utf-8-unix -*-

分配 @
P ∨ (Q ∧ R) ==> P ∨ Q, P ∨ R :- \+ P = Q.

吸収 @
P ∨ (P ∧ _) ==> P.

前件肯定_modus_ponens @
P, P → Q ==> Q.

後件否定_modus_tollens @
¬ Q, P → Q ==> ¬ Q, ¬ P.

否定導入_not @
P → ⊥ ==> ¬ P.
否定導入_not @
P → ⊥(_) ==> ¬ P.

二重否定の除去_double_negative_elimination @
¬ ¬ P ==> P.

選言三段論法_disjunctive_syllogism @
P ∨ Q, ¬ P ==> Q, ¬ P.

仮言三段論法_hypothetical_syllogism @
P → Q, Q → R ==> P → R.

論理和の消去_disjunction_elimination @
P → Q, R → Q, P ∨ R ==> Q.

論理和の消去_disjunction_elimination @
P ∨ P ==> P.

論理積の消去_conjunction_elimination @
P ∧ Q ==> P, Q.

論理積の消去_conjunction_elimination @
P, P ==> P.

矛盾律_contradiction @
A, ¬ A ==> ⊥(A).

導出_resolution @
L ∨ P, ¬ L ∨ Q ==> P ∨ Q
:- L \= P, L \= ¬ P, ¬ L \= P,
   L \= Q, L \= ¬ Q, ¬ L \= Q.

